    "### Part 5: Clustering molecules by strucutre\n",
    "\n",
    "Use fingerprints to group molecules into clusters (using k-means clustering) and visualise via PCA. Tasks:\n",
    "- Experiment with different numbers of clusters\n",
    "- Compute the average solubility per cluster\n",
    "- Do certain clusters correspond to highly or poorly soluble compounds?"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 37,
   "id": "756d49a5",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
